WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle 
and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item 
of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge 
and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:28.010
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's 
soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.850
He battles alongside his trusted 
friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked 
in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your 
facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach 
you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.120
We are guardians of the underground dungeon.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.160
We are the Labyrinth Brothers.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:56.500
Welcome to our Labyrinth Field.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.520
What's this?

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.840
He captured Wall Shadow?

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:13.110
We'll show you that we're 
the greatest tag team.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.800
Let's go, Yugi!

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.080
Yeah!  We'll win with the power of teamwork!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.080
Three Gods Combine!
Gate Guardian

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.640
Wait for me, Mokuba.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:52.080
Long time no see, Seto.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.320
Saruwatari.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:03.000
It's unfortunate that we 
have to meet like this.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.900
You'll pay for betraying me.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:12.000
I'm only following Industrial 
Illusions's orders.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.840
I will guide you to Mr. Pegasus's castle.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.180
Do you think you can threaten me?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:23.250
If you say no, I'll pull the trigger.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:24.850
Try me.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.020
Then die!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:32.560
What?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.790
A card?

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.100
It's your fault that this 
valuable card was damaged!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:40.780
Damn!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:58.450
If you try that again, you 
won't get off so easily.

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:02.240
Take me to Mokuba.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.250
Axe Raider is my only monster on the field.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.960
It's not strong enough to support Yugi.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:36.360
I'll add Flame Swordsman to 
the field in attack position.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.800
It's Level 5, but I'll 
only move it four spaces.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:49.600
I also move Axe Raider four 
spaces to join Celtic Guardian.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:55.660
Since Kunai with Chain used its trap 
effect, it's now a regular Equip Card.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.800
It raises Axe Raider's attack points by 500.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:03.280
I end my turn.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.120
So you've gathered your forces together.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.200
My turn!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.650
Labyrinth Tank advances!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:17.340
This tank is a heavyweight 
destructive weapon.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:20.670
You'll soon enter its firing range.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:27.040
And my trap planted a Jirai 
Gumo in the path ahead of you.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:31.110
You won't get through this labyrinth's traps!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.880
My turn.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.160
I play Dark Magician in attack position.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.720
I move it five spaces to stand 
in front of Celtic Guardian.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:48.080
This strengthens our battle formation.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.630
What will you do?

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:58.570
They plan to conquer the labyrinth by combining 
their forces and increasing their attack points.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.640
My turn.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.110
But their attempts are futile.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.880
This card will break up their combo.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.640
I play this card!

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.800
What's happening?

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.300
The Labyrinth is changing shape.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:32.840
Oh no!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.090
He split our party!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.240
Your monsters have been separated.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:45.360
In a tag duel, we should 
target the weaker of the two.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:49.280
So we're setting our sights on him!

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:52.350
Damn.  My turn.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.240
Calm down, Joey.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.200
I know.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.760
Axe Raider and Flame Swordsman move forward.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.470
We caught you.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.350
The trap card activates!

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.440
What?

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:18.400
Jirai Gumo attacks Axe Raider!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:30.400
Jirai Gumo's trap effect reduces Axe 
Raider's attack points to its original 1700.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.400
What?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.680
Axe Raider is destroyed.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.920
Jonouchi...

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.880
Damn!  They're playing dirty again!

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:46.080
We'll pressure you even further.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.710
My turn!

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:50.240
Labyrinth Tank advances.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.520
I play another monster in defense position.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:07.100
Flame Swordsman is within 
Labyrinth Tank's firing range.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.360
Flame Swordsman will be destroyed next turn.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:14.040
And Dungeon Worm also awaits.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.480
What will you do?

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.320
This is bad.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.410
If nothing changes, Flame 
Swordsman will be destroyed.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.750
My turn.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:34.530
I play the spell card Mystic Box 
and combo it with Dark Magician.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.630
What?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.140
Swords?

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.780
You've lost your mind and 
sacrificed your own monster.

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:51.840
Look.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.600
Another box?

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:57.320
I don't see Jirai Gumo!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.920
Jirai Gumo is skewered!

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:11.180
What?

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:16.800
Dark Magician used the 
Mystic Box to teleport.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:23.010
By tributing one opponent, it can 
move to its position and attack.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:25.040
You saved me, Yugi.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.610
Dark Magician attacks!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:35.840
Black Magic!

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.920
Labyrinth Tank is destroyed.

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:48.480
With our teamwork, we'll overcome 
any walls that stand in our way!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:54.160
Open it.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.680
They'll find you eventually.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.160
I said open it.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.320
Big brother.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.850
My turn.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.390
This card is Sanga of the Thunder.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:55.580
Sanga is one of the three gods that 
control lightning, wind and water.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:11:00.560
The remaining two cards 
are Kazejin and Suijin.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:05.940
When all three are together, they 
combine to form Gate Guardian.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.720
Stop smirking!

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.210
Hurry up!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:11.600
Don't be impatient.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.620
I set this card and end my turn.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.770
I see.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.490
What is that?

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:27.280
I don't know, but we'll 
find out when we get close.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:28.730
My turn.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.360
I'll move Flame Swordsman forward.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.110
I end my turn.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:41.680
I won't let them escape this Labyrinth 
until Gate Guardian arrives.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.280
My turn.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.890
I set this card on the field.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.220
What are those boxes?

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:57.840
I don't know.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:01.800
The field is turning foul.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:05.250
This is more than just the Labyrinth 
Field's oppressive nature.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.940
It must be the overwhelming presence 
of the enemies hiding in those boxes.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.480
All that remains is Kazejin.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:16.050
I'll weaken my opponent's offense for now.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:22.070
I summon Dungeon Worm in attack position.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:30.000
I use Invigoration to increase 
its attack points by 400.

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.240
What?

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.480
Where did it go?

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.310
What?

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:46.320
Celtic Guardian falls prey to Dungeon Worm!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:56.880
C'mon!  You're playing dirty!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.960
That's right!  You have all 
the advantages in this duel!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.800
This is...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.250
...why the Labyrinth is terrifying.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.830
What should we do?  We can't attack 
it when it's hiding underground.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.960
It's my turn.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:12.770
I play the card Magical Hats!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.840
I combine it with Dark Magician.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.000
What?

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.220
He hid their monsters.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.920
This will confuse their freaky earthworm!

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:33.330
I can do a trick attack by combining 
Magical Hats with Dark Magician.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:38.760
Dark Magician and Flame Swordsman are 
each hiding in one of the four hats.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:44.290
Dungeon Worm has 2200 attack points.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:49.120
It will be destroyed if it attacks my Dark 
Magician because it has 2500 attack points.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:53.200
In that case, I'll play this card.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:58.000
I play Monster Tamer in attack position!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.550
Why did you do that?

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:08.530
Normally, I can't use my 
brother's Dungeon Worm.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:19.200
But thanks to Monster Tamer, Dungeon Worm 
gains 600 attack points, and I can use it this turn.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:23.660
It has more attack points than Dark Magician.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:26.130
If the attack hits, my 
monster will be destroyed.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.040
Dungeon Worm, come on!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.720
The odds are one in two.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.330
I missed.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.960
Whew.  That was close.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:50.400
We were lucky, but Dungeon Worm 
will attack again next turn.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.760
If nothing changes, it's only 
a matter of time until we lose.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:55.110
What should we do?

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.560
It's my turn!

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:02.180
I never liked small, dark spaces.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.750
Jonouchi!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.920
What are you thinking, Jonouchi?

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.900
Witness the power of this card!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.260
The spell card Salamandra!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:21.520
It inhabits a Fire Attribute monster's 
sword, raising its attack points by 700.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.210
Go, Salamandra!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.070
What?

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:36.020
I see!  Monster Tamer's effect is now gone, 
so Dungeon Worm is back to 2200 attack points.

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:40.820
Salamandra's flame can roast monsters 
that are hiding underground.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.480
See ya, you freaky earthworm!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.880
All right!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.560
Well done, Jonouchi!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.900
He did it!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.560
Stay calm, brother.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.880
My turn!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.040
I finally drew it!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.440
That means our victory...

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.800
...is assured.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.720
Kazejin!

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.840
We now have all three gods!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.520
What?

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.320
Three gods?

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:30.240
The three gods of thunder, water and wind!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:34.470
Combine your powers and 
resurrect with a roar!

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.770
What's that?

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.210
What?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:43.680
Come out, Gate Guardian!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.860
Gate Guardian?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.920
It looks incredible.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.480
What is that?

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.920
It's a guardian god that protects 
both doors of the Labyrinth.

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:00.480
A god that guards the doors?

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:03.040
So if they don't destroy it...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.570
There's no way to escape.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:09.680
The Labyrinth Field's final 
boss has finally appeared.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.510
I'll destroy it!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.250
Too bad.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.620
Before you could escape from the Labyrinth...

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:20.490
...we were able to summon 
the almighty Gate Guardian.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.860
You'll never reach the door.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.330
You'll be buried by our combined god!

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:29.360
Be quiet!  Stop talking!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:34.370
Since you combined, we'll fight 
back with teamwork!  Here we go!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.400
Bring it on!

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.010
Are we there yet?

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:43.840
You seem very worried about Mokuba.

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:47.420
The bond between brothers must be strong.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.040
Stop talking.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.190
And that's how you always helped each other.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:18:00.000
You two lost your parents at a young age, 
but you heroically helped each other to survive.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.130
What a touching story.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.300
I told you to stop talking!

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.720
Pardon me.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:11.740
Don't worry.  We haven't 
harmed your precious Mokuba.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.680
We're almost there.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:31.840
Big brother.

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.800
Let's stay together forever.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.200
I don't want us to be apart.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.500
Don't worry.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.420
You promise?

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.840
I promise.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.880
I'll be fine because my 
brother made me a promise.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:54.640
That we'll never be apart.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.450
This is the place.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.240
What do you mean?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.600
I led you to this spot.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.720
What?

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.930
How dare you!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:13.370
The situation can change for anyone.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:16.080
Security will be here soon.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.360
You lowlife!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:22.240
I hope you have an emotional reunion.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:29.420
We found Seto Kaiba.  He's 
in the castle basement.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:34.000
I know.  I've foreseen it.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.020
We'll capture him and bring him here.

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.240
That won't be necessary.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:43.520
Turn off the alarm.  It's too noisy.

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:47.530
I'm going to meet Kaiba boy.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.910
Does this mean my brother is here?

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.160
Hang in there, Yugi!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:58.140
Jonouchi, don't lose!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:01.510
I set two cards on my turn.

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:06.450
I end my turn.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.240
My turn.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:11.920
Gate Guardian attacks Flame Swordsman.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.760
There's nowhere to run!  
What should I do, Yugi?

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.080
Lightning Shot!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:40.120
Yugi and Jonouchi fight back against 
Gate Guardian's ferocious attacks.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:43.600
But they can't get past its 
impenetrable defense that easily.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:47.390
At this rate, we'll never 
escape to the surface!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:51.730
Yugi and Jonouchi, if they're going to 
combine, then you should combine too!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.900
Go, B. Skull Dragon!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:58.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Fiend Dragon
B. Skull Dragon

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.840
Duel, standby!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:13.260
The flask glistens

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:21.110
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:30.090
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:37.860
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.690
Shower of happiness

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:47.800
I will shower you with it

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:56.080
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:56.280 --> 00:22:00.320
Shower of happiness

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:04.440
You are not alone

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:11.160
You're protected by a 
giant ring of friendship
